    "create_time": "2026-06-17 16:16",
    "content_noencode": "<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">洛洛的第14篇原创文章</span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">大家好，我是洛洛。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">做过内容的读者老师应该都懂，写文章最难的其实是找选题。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">我做号3年，每周最焦虑就是码字之前那一段。打开七八个 AI 资讯号，刷一遍同行主页，再翻一圈榜单，生怕漏掉哪个热点。一圈忙下来俩小时没了，选题还没定，人倒先刷累了。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">选题靠的是勤奋加记性再加一点运气，偏偏哪样都不太牢靠。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCm4s3Et9GnaCoXPcqia37IqpsNF3BT5NEOCsqEPWspnAVibqWVgwNGoZBvsjccfaq8kEJNR4Aq0pgOkcZz8MrbF9sPyUtdUwqLe0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.524074074074074\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100000933\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">最近办公小浣熊桌面端2.0上线，正好把找选题这个活儿交给它试试。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">办公小浣熊出自商汤科技，底层用的是商汤日日新大模型，官方称用户已经过了 2000 万。桌面端 2.0 跟网页端最大的不一样，是能直接进电脑读文件、开浏览器、自己动手干活。我给自己定了个小目标，让 AI 每天早上8点，自动把一份带标题的选题清单送到我桌面。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">话不多说，我们直接跑案例。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCkX6ByxuWrQcIBYQ7TSdQ3fcwXPtVtfkE6TS3S0OC2mthpPNrby4D2jtXdnzK5BhQZH9dMtjsMIQArVKsFYtXKZJic3PX8ckJew/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.15092592592592594\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100000932\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">案例实测</span></b></span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">第一步：读取我的本地文件</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这一步是通过对历史文章的分析，判断哪些选题在我的账号上数据表现比较好。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">我建了个文件夹叫【洛洛选题雷达】，然后丢进去两样东西，一份从公众号后台导出的内容数据表(标题、阅读、完播、转发都在里头)，外加几篇我自己存档的爆款，有的是 PDF，有的干脆是截图。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmO4icvUc36biaXOKHMeQke7O0TYt0WoJnhibrdBZvZl2yjvL8FJEvYXovibWFL9H4cUUfKibeRwC1DWQ3kj27vkjH4WR8NTGQlBmB8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5407407407407407\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100000935\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">搁网页端，得一篇篇上传。桌面端 2.0 上面把文件夹授权出去、一句话让小浣熊开读就行。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmRpCZeJPDMV6AUUKSoxfnYNxG0xYefJmBeQ0der6sEqIxP54ticAYJn6F7FtI2v2sF1F8SMKLPJ9g1JEWkShgVVX6CxUZrcEcw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.16111111111111112\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100000934\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">小浣熊直接读完文件夹里的 Excel、PDF 和截图(包括图里的文字)，给出我的号内容偏好结论。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/smYNP8B0KCnNibhJAAxOFfhk04tQxnIEX6FUicongd4YKKic7UPwb3RyNfNtWiaPicWMCiaLqe0egX0XOg1ZDgXmP3CyZPPGXF7xgh6DJ871DLDew/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.915\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"800\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100000936\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">读完小浣熊给我下了个判断，我的号在资源福利型、模型横评 、Agent分享类选题上完读最高，我现在的爆文很依赖微信推荐分发。标题、封面、首段钩子要优先服务“陌生推荐流读者”，而不是只服务老粉。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">第二步：喊一支【选题专家团】，三个人分头干</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">然后我就拿着第一步小浣熊给我的结论，找专家团帮我干活了。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">办公小浣熊里有 Skill / 专家 / 专家团的玩法。单个专家，是把一类活儿的要求和套路存成一个固定角色。专家团则是几个专家凑成一组，接到大活儿各管一摊、同时开工，最后并成一份成品。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">我一句话把团建起来，分了三个角色。写作主编、行业研究员和数据分析师。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KClNzf9nK0NeRYTyK4pEeWgtoibEdGEdWa5QQczoNDd8dX2iame8TCkZVDNlnBgRpQnbfas2WhCa2CPZsHyfd0zHJiahuU2P6IVN60/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6148148148148148\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100000939\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">我只说了一句话，小浣熊就把各个专家的分工、工作的流程都给我安排好了，我只需要点击确认就行，如果不满意的还可以自行修改。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/smYNP8B0KClQNoroAWc3hSIMPmcot1JO1gyW77CqkxyiaGMPwMibowP4qXaCBQo8MQhBicHEgWpkrTLN5FUyz91JUpZRNtmaiaAHKqeUuemxib5o/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.76\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"800\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100000941\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">设置好之后，就可以调用专家团为我工作了。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCkNEfPibib1d4mVrR2Kf3aJRkKxoIbicHt7xn8pvwgY6C8VKibGPKWHwA2GUlcqibrZyHNRXPVGAmgr25ianICXZJk3gY8uVjWMtnOqU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.20277777777777778\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100000940\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">专家给我的选题建议，看了一下基本上还是靠谱的，而且还附上了信息来源，这一点真的很贴心。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmQr7zq6T0ibYRce1xicfhkaHshzwSZP7Ml0miaYrgibf4Gjlc1Ivcz3W8sAaJkuGySrKNLwctDJrt5FesraW0dk82hU8WbHmnBVb4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6037037037037037\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100000937\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">第三步：让热点专家自己出门扒新动态</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">小浣熊桌面端可以一句话操控浏览器，我的提示词长这样：</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCnS3kgs01iblPbkPPLibM1KUBdhdG45FFYgKQDocpgnibYt3r9xCHTvUcic9AZib7utsv4Xgnn8ia4GeH13By4DSeHLZBu030rnkFgy8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.17314814814814813\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100000938\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">提示词一发，小浣熊就会提醒去启用浏览器。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCnqCgynkvvlNz1t3W8IBNLYLCZekdX50TiapNo1MtdiaPnuYsPthC4xh5nbia6bwcDxpeCY6J9PVVqZNz7uKs9XWACqXQ54ZnbdVE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5398148148148149\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100000943\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">点击链接之后，只需要在这里点击启用浏览器就好，还是挺简单的。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCkqQ46ZE4v6XYCCEnkk2ewKaYIRHFj4YwJeL4WJXqWBdlrlUPj36G2jDGIwrRbIlpaVqNLZFWl5vx2EqSrhtlfPHbwolYp9SrM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6305555555555555\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100000945\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">浏览器启用好之后，就会看到小浣熊自己开了几十上百个页面开始抓内容了。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0